    "local": {
      "gdd -> please provide the daily minimum and maximum temperatures (in °c) and the base temperature (in °c) to calculate the accumulated heat (gdd).": 2,
      "vpd -> please provide the temperature (t) and relative humidity (rh) values in degrees celsius and percent, respectively, to calculate the vapour pressure deficit (vpd) using the supplied formula.": 1,
      "et0 -> please provide the daily temperature (t), relative humidity (rh), wind speed at 2 meters (u2), and net radiation (rn) values in mj/m2/day for the location and period where fao-56 reference evapotranspiration is needed.": 1,
      "rain_deficit -> please provide the target rainfall value and the current rainfall values needed to calculate the rainfall deficit relative to the target.": 1,
      "gdd -> для оценки тепловую сумму по tmin/tmax и base необходимо указать значения tmin, tmax и base (в градусах цельсия) для каждого дня. также требуется указать период (например, 1990-2020 гг.) и базу (например, 10°c).": 1,
